{"id":"aque_l","lemma":"aquél","pos":"pron","rank":1706,"glosses":["that one (often with the meaning of \"over there\", sometimes contrasted with ése)","the former","anyone/anything"],"ipa":"/aˈkel/","forms":{"feminine":"aquélla","masculinePlural":"aquéllos","femininePlural":"aquéllas"},"examples":[{"text":"Aquél no es mío.","en":"That isn't mine.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/559027"},{"text":"¿Cuál prefieres? ¿Ésta o aquélla?","en":"Which one do you prefer, this one or that one?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/691774"},{"text":"Aquéllos son mis libros.","en":"Those are my books.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/501091"},{"text":"¿Llevan aquéllas faldas blancas?","en":"Do those girls wear white skirts?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/684430"},{"text":"¿Es aquél el tuyo?","en":"Is that one yours?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/559030"}]}